whose vectors are still in that image. -/
theorem hilbertBasis_in_polynomial_range {H : Type*} [NormedAddCommGroup H]
    [InnerProductSpace ℂ H] [CompleteSpace H]
    (T : Polynomial ℂ →ₗ[ℂ] H) (hT : Function.Injective T)
